<includeonly>{{#invoke:CinderData|item|id={{{id|}}}}}</includeonly><noinclude>
The stats box for one item. The bot puts it at the top of every item page; the numbers come from the mod and update by themselves after each sync.

Usage: <code><nowiki>{{Item|id=ashenblade}}</nowiki></code>

The bot adds this to new pages. You do not need to change it; write your text around it. The data is read from the <code>Data:</code> pages and drawn by [[Module:CinderData]].

